---
layout: pgt-layout.njk
title: UP PGT English PYQs
description: Take UP PGT English previous-year papers as an online test, with a clock and a full answer review. Free, with no login required.
crumb_label: PYQs
pgt_practice_index: true
pgt_practice_hero_title: English PYQs
pgt_practice_collection_label: PYQs
pgt_resources: true
---
{#- CLAUDE.md rule 23. The cards come from _data/pgtPyqs.json (grouped by year in _data/pgtPyqYears.js). A new year is
    one registry line plus its question file; this page needs no change. Free, no login (owner, 2026-11-19). -#}
<section class="pgt-practice-index" aria-labelledby="pgt-practice-index-title">
  <header class="pgt-practice-intro">
    <div>
      <h2 id="pgt-practice-index-title">Choose a year</h2>
      <p>Each paper opens as a real test, with one question at a time, a clock and a full review at the end. Every paper is free for everyone, with no login required.</p>
    </div>
    <span>{{ pgtPyqPapers.length }} paper{% if pgtPyqPapers.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
  </header>
  <div class="pgt-practice-groups">
    {% for group in pgtPyqYears %}
    <details class="pgt-practice-group" open>
      <summary>
        <img class="pgt-practice-group-icon" src="/assets/icons/tabler/files.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28">
        <span>{{ group.year }}</span>
        <small>{{ group.papers.length }} paper{% if group.papers.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</small>
        <img class="pgt-practice-chevron" src="/assets/icons/feather/chevron-down.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22">
      </summary>
      <div class="pgt-practice-card-grid">
        {% for paper in group.papers %}
        <div class="pgt-practice-card">
          <span class="pgt-practice-card-copy"><strong>UP PGT English {{ paper.year }}</strong><span>{{ paper.count }} questions · Free · No login</span></span>
          <a class="agehub-go is-solid" href="{{ paper.href }}" aria-label="Start the UP PGT English {{ paper.year }} paper">Start</a>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% for paper in group.papers %}{% if paper.leftOut %}
      {% if paper.leftOutNote %}<p class="pgt-pyq-leftout">{{ paper.leftOutNote }}</p>{% else %}<p class="pgt-pyq-leftout">The printed {{ paper.year }} paper has {{ paper.printedCount }} questions. We show {{ paper.count }}, because {{ paper.leftOut }} question{% if paper.leftOut != 1 %}s{% endif %} have damaged options in our copy.</p>{% endif %}
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="pgt-pyq-disclaimer">{% include "pgt-pyq-disclaimer.njk" %}</p>
</section>
